OL,3,GNEWSARape suspect told girl he wanted
OL,4,Ato 'protect her'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old girl was raped near a
OL,7,Frecreation ground by a man who told her
OL,8,Fhe wanted to "protect her", police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,12,Fthe teenager was walking near Eccles
OL,13,FRecreation Ground in Salford before she
OL,14,Fwas attacked between 23:00 GMT on 23
OL,15,FOctober and 02:00 on 24 October.
OL,17,FBefore following the girl and attacking
OL,18,Fher a short time later, the man shouted
OL,19,Fthat he "wanted to protect her". A GMP
OL,20,Fspokesperson said the victim was too
OL,21,F"terrified" to run away.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
