OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force has released a CCTV image of
OL,7,Fthe suspect, who is described as white,
OL,8,Fabout 5ft 7in (1.7m) tall, with brown
OL,9,Fshoulder-length hair, a goatee beard
OL,10,Fand a moustache.
